findings.remediation:
Remove the template provider block from example/examplea/terraform.tf:
  template = {
    source  = "hashicorp/template"
    version = "2.2.0"
  }

Add a lifecycle block to google_storage_bucket.statebucket:
  lifecycle {
    prevent_destroy = true
  }

Remove the checkov:skip and add a logging block pointing at a dedicated log bucket:
  logging {
    log_bucket        = var.log_bucket
    log_object_prefix = "state-access/"
  }
If a log bucket is not available, expose a log_bucket variable with no default so callers are forced to supply one.

Add file_permission = "0600" to restrict the generated file to the owner only:
  resource "local_file" "remote_state" {
    content         = templatefile(...)
    filename        = "remote_state.tf"
    file_permission = "0600"
  }
